    "setup": [
     "A passing drill on pitch two on a Tuesday, nothing in it. {mate.name} turns to take one and goes down like somebody's switched him off. Nobody touched him. He doesn't put his hands out.",
     "The physio is at the far end with somebody's ankle. Forty yards."
    ],
    "talk": {
     "start": "a",
     "nodes": {
      "a": {
       "who": "physio",
       "say": [
        "Somebody screams for {physio.short}. The lads are frozen in a ring. {mate.short} isn't breathing right."
       ],
       "replies": [
        {
         "id": "cpr",
         "label": "Get on your knees and start pushing on his chest.",
         "tone": "brave",
         "goto": "b"
        },
        {
         "id": "run",
         "label": "Sprint for the defibrillator in the clubhouse.",
         "tone": "brave",
         "goto": "c"
        },
        {
         "id": "froze",
         "label": "You can't move.",
         "tone": "humble",
         "silent": true,
         "end": "froze"
        }
       ]
      },
      "b": {
       "who": "physio",
       "say": [
        "You remember the course in the academy you thought was a waste of a morning. Hard and fast, the middle of the chest. Somebody counts out loud. It might be you."
       ],
       "replies": [
        {
         "id": "keep",
         "label": "Keep going till she gets there.",
         "tone": "brave",
         "end": "cpr"
        }
       ]
      },
      "c": {
       "who": "physio",
       "say": [
        "The clubhouse. The yellow box by the canteen door. The alarm goes off when you open it, which you didn't know it did."
       ],
       "replies": [
        {
         "id": "back",
         "label": "Run it back.",
         "tone": "brave",
         "end": "box"
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     "ends": {
      "cpr": [
       {
        "text": "{physio.short} takes over after a minute that lasts a year. The ambulance comes on to the pitch. In the car park the gaffer can't light his cigarette.",
