    "setup": [
     "He's awake, in a ward with a view of the multi-storey, with a box on his chest the size of a matchbox they've put in under the skin. The doctors say his heart has a fault he was born with. Nobody could have known."
    ],
    "talk": {
     "start": "a",
     "nodes": {
      "a": {
       "who": "mate",
       "say": [
        "\"They say I can't play again.\" He laughs, and stops because it hurts. \"Twenty-six. What am I going to do, work?\""
       ],
       "replies": [
        {
         "id": "stay",
         "label": "Sit with him till they throw you out.",
         "tone": "kind",
         "end": "stay"
        },
        {
         "id": "joke",
         "label": "\"You could be a pundit. You're wrong about everything.\"",
         "tone": "confident",
         "end": "joke"
        },
        {
         "id": "cry",
         "label": "Tell him you thought he'd died.",
         "tone": "honest",
         "end": "cry"
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     "ends": {
      "stay": [
       {
        "text": "You watch the darts on a telly on a bracket. When the nurse throws you out he's asleep.",
        "npc": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "bond": 6
         }
        ],
        "arc": {
         "set": {
          "mid": "stay"
         }
        }
       }
      ],
      "joke": [
       {
        "text": "He laughs till the nurse tells you off. He says it's the best he's felt all week.",
        "npc": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "bond": 6
         }
        ],
        "arc": {
         "set": {
          "mid": "joke"
         }
        }
       }
      ],
      "cry": [
       {
        "text": "He goes quiet and holds your wrist for a while. Neither of you says anything for a long time.",
        "npc": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "bond": 8
         }
        ],
        "arc": {
         "set": {
          "mid": "cry"
         }
        }
       }
      ]
     }
